    name: { de: "Lago de Coatepeque", hu: "Coatepeque-tó", ro: "Lago de Coatepeque", en: "Lake Coatepeque" },
    description: { de: "A caldera lake with clear water and lakeside biodiversity.", hu: "Kalderató tiszta vízzel és gazdag part menti biodiverzitással.", ro: "A caldera lake with clear water and lakeside biodiversity.", en: "A caldera lake with clear water and lakeside biodiversity." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Inside an ancient caldera.", "Popular for swimming and boating.", "Birds around the shoreline."],
      hu: ["Egy ősi kalderában található.", "Népszerű úszáshoz és hajózáshoz.", "Madarak a part mentén."],
      ro: ["Inside an ancient caldera.", "Popular for swimming and boating.", "Birds around the shoreline."],
      en: ["Inside an ancient caldera.", "Popular for swimming and boating.", "Birds around the shoreline."]
    },
    
     image: "/poi-images/lago-de-coatepeque-life-v2.webp",
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "A caldera lake with clear water and lakeside biodiversity. Inside an ancient caldera. Popular for swimming and boating. Birds around the shoreline. Damit zählt der Ort zu den charakteristischen Punkten der mittelamerikanischen Republik El Salvador und spiegelt die Verbindung von pazifischer Küste, vulkanischer Landschaft, Kaffee- und Zuckerrohranbau sowie dem Wiederaufbau nach dem Bürgerkrieg wider. Liegt in El Salvador, dem kleinsten Staat Mittelamerikas am Pazifik. Tropisches Klima mit ausgeprägter Regen- und Trockenzeit prägt die Region. Hauptstadt San Salvador ist das politische, wirtschaftliche und kulturelle Zentrum des Landes.",
      hu: "A Coatepeque-tó El Salvador egyik leglátványosabb természeti képződménye, egy hatalmas vulkáni kráterben kialakult tó. A kristálytiszta víz és a környező hegyek látványa miatt gyakran illetik a 'világ egyik legszebb tava' címmel. Különlegessége, hogy bizonyos években a víz színe rejtélyes módon türkizkékké változik a benne lévő ásványi anyagok és algák miatt. A tó ideális helyszín vízi sportokhoz, például búvárkodáshoz, vitorlázáshoz és kajakozáshoz. A part mentén elegáns villák és hangulatos éttermek sorakoznak, ahonnan a látogatók a tó közepén fekvő Teopán-szigetre is ráláthatnak, amely egykor a maják szent helye volt.",
      ro: "Lacul Coatepeque este considerat unul dintre cele mai frumoase lacuri din lume, fiind situat în interiorul unei caldere vulcanice gigantice. Apa sa de un albastru intens și marginile abrupte ale craterului creează un peisaj de o rară eleganță naturală. Uneori, apa lacului își schimbă culoarea în mod spectaculos, căpătând o nuanță de turcoaz vibrant datorită fenomenelor ciclice ale algelor și mineralelor. Este o destinație populară pentru sporturi nautice și relaxare, având numeroase puncte de observație pe șoseaua ce îl înconjoară. În centrul lacului se află insula Teopán, un vechi loc sacru al civilizației maya.",
      en: "Lake Coatepeque is one of El Salvador's most spectacular natural formations, a large lake formed within a massive volcanic crater. Due to the crystal-clear water and the view of surrounding mountains, it is often called one of the most beautiful lakes in the world. A unique feature is that in certain years, the water color mysteriously turns turquoise due to minerals and algae. The lake is an ideal location for water sports such as diving, sailing, and kayaking. Elegant villas and cozy restaurants line the shore, where visitors can also see Teopán Island in the middle of the lake, which was once a sacred place for the Maya. Geography K8"
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["A caldera lake with clear water and lakeside biodiversity.", "Liegt in El Salvador, dem kleinsten Staat Mittelamerikas am Pazifik.", "Tropisches Klima mit ausgeprägter Regen- und Trockenzeit prägt die Region.", "Hauptstadt San Salvador ist das politische, wirtschaftliche und kulturelle Zentrum des Landes.", "Vulkane wie Izalco, Santa Ana und San Vicente prägen die Topografie El Salvadors."],
      hu: ["Egy hatalmas kalderában fekszik, amely 25 000 - 72 000 évvel ezelőtt alakult ki.", "Legnagyobb mélysége eléri a 115 métert.", "A Teopán-sziget maja szertartási központ volt.", "2013-ban második helyezést ért el a 'világ nyolcadik csodája' szavazáson."],
      ro: ["S-a format într-o calderă creată în urma unor erupții masive acum mii de ani.", "Adâncimea maximă a lacului atinge aproximativ 115 metri.", "Insula Teopán din interior a fost un centru ceremonial mayaș.", "A fost finalist în competiția pentru cele opt minuni ale lumii în 2013."],
      en: ["Situated in a large caldera formed between 25,000 and 72,000 years ago.", "Its maximum depth reaches 115 meters.", "Teopán Island served as a Maya ceremonial center.", "In 2013, it was a runner-up for the 'Eighth Wonder of the World' title."]
    }
